Package: MIDS
Title: Multi-Frame Individual Distinctions by Size
Version: 1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
      "Hayden", "Swift",
      email = "hayden.swift@newcastle.edu.au",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides tools for applying Multi-Frame Individual
    Distinctions by Size (MIDS) to stereo-video observations.
    The package estimates distinct individuals by comparing fish
    length measurements across frames while accounting for
    measurement precision and uncertainty.
